part registers
  tally 2
  note "Faktura+ sales and purchase registers (records/faktura-*.csv): every row, each in a version known on its issue (sales) or receipt (purchases) day. The files are semicolon CSVs no text loads (O:B-1); the rows are written out, each citing its file and line."

